    <div class="page">
        <h2 style="margin-top: 0;">III. SCOPE OF WORK/SPECIFICATIONS</h2>
        <p>Acquisition: The University is seeking a capable vendor to provide, deliver, and install an automatically-adjusting sound masking system for the 2nd and 3rd floors of Francis Marion University's University Place building. Installation to be initiated with awarded vendor for times and dates mutually agreed upon by the vendor and the University.</p>
        <p>ACQUIRE SERVICES & SUPPLIES / EQUIPMENT (JAN 2006): The purpose of this solicitation is to acquire services and supplies or equipment complying with the enclosed description and/or specifications and conditions. [01-1005-1]</p>

        <h3 style="margin-top: 30px;">Background Information:</h3>
        <p>The automatically-adjusting sound masking system sought for purchase, delivery, and installation in this solicitation is to mask noise distractions between the floors of Francis Marion University's University Place building located in downtown Florence, SC 29506. The purchase, delivery, and installation of this system is intended to reduce noise distractions, protect speech privacy, and more in the University Place building.</p>

        <h3 style="margin-top: 30px;">Specifications:</h3>
        <ul>
            <li>Francis Marion University seeks an automatically-adjusting sound masking solution for the 2nd and 3rd floors of the University Place located at: <span data-field="university_place_address">{{ university_place_address }}</span>, Florence, SC 29506.</li>
            <li>System must have the capability to adjust automatically the sound masking ability based on the ambient or current noise levels. Market research has identified this feature as "adaptive adjustment," "adaptive volume adjustment," "adaptive masking," and/or "adaptive volume control," and it is a necessary feature of the sound masking system needed.</li>
            <li>Must be free from defects in parts.</li>
            <li>Solution must be a turn-key solution where the contractor provides and delivers all necessary labor, equipment, installation, and materials for a complete job.</li>
            <li>System must run on normal 120 volt circuits.</li>
            <li>Equipment shall be installed or mounted in the ceiling and shall match the color of its surrounding area (in most cases, white).</li>
            <li>The successful bidder shall provide for the delivery of all quoted equipment.</li>
            <li>The successful bidder shall provide for the full installation of all quoted equipment.</li>
            <li>The contractor must provide a minimum 5-year warranty on all installed parts and equipment.</li>
            <li>The contractor must provide a minimum 1-year installation warranty.</li>
        </ul>

        <h3 style="margin-top: 30px;">Item Details:</h3>
        <p><strong>Item #1 - Delivery of all necessary sound masking equipment for University Place 2nd floor including a five (5) year parts/equipment warranty</strong></p>
        <p><strong>Item #2 - Delivery of all necessary sound masking equipment for University Place 3rd floor including a five (5) year parts/equipment warranty</strong></p>
        <p><strong>Item #3 - Installation of parts/equipment quoted from Item #1 AND Item #2 including a one (1) year installation warranty</strong></p>
        <p>Provide all labor and materials to install all sound masking equipment quoted from Item #1 and Item #2. In coordination with a University representative, the contractor shall test the equipment to verify proper installation and working order of the installed equipment.</p>
        <p><strong>Note:</strong> Award will be made for the entirety of this project (Items 1 – 3). Offeror must provide quotation and requested pricing for all of the individual line items.</p>
    </div>

